swagger-ui-dist (vendored)
Copyright 2020-2021 SmartBear Software Inc.

This directory vendors a subset of the `swagger-ui-dist` npm package,
pinned at version 5.33.0 (https://www.npmjs.com/package/swagger-ui-dist),
so that TiferetApiContext.create_swagger_blueprint can serve the Swagger UI
assets from this package without a runtime CDN dependency.

Files vendored: swagger-ui.css, swagger-ui-bundle.js
Upstream project: https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Changing the pinned version is a docs/assets commit, not an RFP amendment,
unless the HTML contract (SwaggerUIBundle + local css/js) changes.
